#ASSERT `max` `o5` TRUE TRUE `bank pc` TRUE EQUALS `pun` 100000 20 0
#ASSERT `max` `o4` FALSE FALSE `bank pc` TRUE EQUALS `pun` 50000 10 0
#ASSERT `max` `o8` FALSE FALSE `bank pc` TRUE EQUALS `pun` 10000 3 0
-- C22-C26 s 11(2)-(3)
#ASSERT `a protected computer` (`pc` TRUE `banking use` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `a protected computer` (`pc` TRUE `banking use` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `a protected computer` (`pc` TRUE `banking use` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `a protected computer` (`pc` TRUE `banking use` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `a protected computer` (`pc` TRUE `none of the s 11(2) uses` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- C27-C30 s 8A(5)
#ASSERT `the caning strokes for` (`o8A with` (`scamf` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)) `, an individual:` TRUE EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the caning strokes for` (`o8A with` (`scamf` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)) `, an individual:` TRUE EQUALS 12
