#ASSERT `the caning strokes for` (`o8B with` `obt` `no scamf`) `, an individual:` TRUE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the caning strokes for` (`o8B with` `sup` (`scamf` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)) `, an individual:` TRUE EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the caning strokes for` (`o8B with` `sup` (`scamf` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)) `, an individual:` TRUE EQUALS 12
-- C35
#ASSERT `the caning strokes for` `o3` `, an individual:` TRUE EQUALS 0
-- caning carried through the maximum punishment
#ASSERT `max` (`o8A with` (`scamf` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)) FALSE FALSE `no pc` TRUE EQUALS `pun` 10000 3 12

