§§ `E. Vintage gate and the top-level goal`

#ASSERT REFUSED `the computer misuse position for` (`case on` (YMD 2025 12 29) `o3`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `the computer misuse position for` (`case on` (YMD 2020 6 1) `o3`)
#ASSERT (`the computer misuse position for` (`case on` (YMD 2025 12 30) `o3`))'s `maximum punishment` EQUALS JUST (`pun` 5000 2 0)
#ASSERT (`the computer misuse position for` (`case on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `o3`))'s `the offence is made out`
#ASSERT (`the computer misuse position for` (`case on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `o3`))'s `most that may be collected to compound` EQUALS JUST 3000
